{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は公演稽古。\n今日は学校の体力測定やったよ。\nそこそこでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていうか、日に日に体力が\n落ちてる気がする...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腹筋背筋やろう！うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラス替えは好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のクラスが楽しかった分\nちょっと寂しいけど、\n新しいクラスも、わくわくする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き嫌いではないよね。\nその時によって違うよ！たぶん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達作るの得意な方ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"状況による。\nでも、得意ではない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかスーツ好きかい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキッとしててかっくいいです。\n私もスーツ似合うようになりたい。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の時は握手券を一気に出すか\n分けて出すか、どっちが良いですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちが良いとかそんなのないよ！\nどっちでも嬉しいよ！\nだって握手しに来てくれるんでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握の時サイリウム何色がいい？\nやっぱり紫？それとも黄緑？(^ ^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木カラーは紫だけど、\n私は黄緑がすきかなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエ習っているのですが、\n４歳から習ってるのに、なかなか\n体が柔らかくなりません\nどうしたらいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間の身体ってそれぞれ違うから\nもともと柔らかい人もいるし、\nもともと硬い人もいるよね。\n私は習ってた頃、バレエが好きすぎて\n家でも毎日ストレッチして踊ってたよ♪\nだから身体も柔らかくなったし、\n踊りやすくなった。\nレッスンの時以外でも、ちゃんと\n身体をほぐしてたら\nすぐ柔らかくなるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れ！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔が赤くなることについて\nコメントありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあ、本当人間の身体って\nわからんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹が痛くなるのだって\nびっくりしてるのか\nムカムカしてるのか\n緊張してるのか...他にもいろいろ\nいろーんな感情から出るもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"果たしてこの顔が熱くなるのは\n照れてるのか緊張してるのか\n興奮してるのか拒否反応か..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもこの体質？と闘おう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンルームと闘おう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、\n明日もお稽古がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイッチ入れなきゃ。\nエンジンかけなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/12/7674238/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お口の中にガム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌、治れーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}